<title>JAPAN: Japan August kerosene imports balloon yr/yr - MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan August kerosene imports balloon yr/yr - MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Trade Ministry on Thursday issued the following data on oil product imports during August (barrel equivalents are also shown):</p>
<p>	 (In 1,000 kl)(1,000 bbl) mth/mth%  yr/yr %</p>
<p> Gasoline     228	1,434     -5.8	-20.8</p>
<p> Naphtha    2,604     16,379     -9.0	-10.3</p>
<p> Kerosene     159	1,000     +6.7     +835.3</p>
<p> Gas oil	 38	  239    -74.3	-77.5</p>
<p> Fuel oil A   102	  642     -4.7	+47.8</p>
<p> Fuel oil C   287	1,805    -17.8     +441.5</p>
<p>(Note: LSWR imports are included in the Fuel oil C statistics)</p>
</text>
